title: Constant step-function baseline
tags: ['baseline', 'autocorrelation']
abstract: A simple constant nonnegative step function supplied as a valid format seed.
content: |
  def construct_autocorrelation() -> str:
      weights = [1.0] * 64
      return "#mode=step-v1\n" + repr(weights)
